# Qualification case packages are digest-backed. Every artifact's declared
# sha256 was computed from the exact bytes committed here, and
# `resolve_artifact` recomputes it from the bytes on disk.
#
# End-of-line conversion would therefore break the package on checkout rather
# than at authoring time: a clone with `core.autocrlf=true` would rewrite these
# files, every digest would stop matching, and the failure would look like
# tampering. `-text` disables all EOL translation for this subtree.
docs/qualification/pilot/** -text
